WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu’s Drive Rush standing heavy punch connects.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.950
Heavy Hashogeki launches Elena.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.050
The gold OD High Blade Kick sends Elena away.

4
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.550
Ryu dashes beneath Elena to the other side.

5
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.500
Light Shoryuken catches Elena from the switched side.

6
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Elena falls with Ryu now on the opposite side.
